<title>BAHRAIN: PRESS DIGEST - Bahrain - Oct 28.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Bahrain - Oct 28.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are some of the leading stories in the Bahraini press on Monday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>AKHBAR AL KHALEEJ</p>
<p>- Gulf central bank governors meet in Bahrain to discuss the possibilities of unifying their currencies.</p>
<p>GULF DAILY NEWS</p>
<p>- World Bank official says Gulf Arab states' monetary laws need to be reviewed.</p>
<p>- Saudi share prices up on active bourse last week.</p>
